# Mirkwood Pathmaker, a */*: its power and toughness come from a characteristic-defining ability (CR 604.3). Bot1 has a Forest (so it
# is a 1/1) and enchants it with Enchanted River's Grasp, "Enchanted creature loses all abilities": with the ability gone its
# power and toughness are 0 (the * has nothing to stand for), a 0/0 that state-based actions put into the graveyard (CR 704.5f),
# and the Aura with it (CR 704.5m).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mirkwood Pathmaker
Enchanted River's Grasp
Forest
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Mirkwood Pathmaker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mirkwood Pathmaker.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enchanted River's Grasp.Cast(Mirkwood Pathmaker)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mirkwood Pathmaker = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Enchanted River's Grasp = (absent)
